                <head>Rejection by President Wilson of
                    autonomy as a solution of the Czecho-Slovak and Jugo-Slav questions, October
                    19—Arrangements for a loan to the Czecho-Slovak National Council—The
                    establishment of national authorities in Czecho-Slovak and Jugo-Slav
                    territories—Friction between the Jugo-Slavs and Italians</head>
                <p>[For the declaration to the Austro-Hungarian Government that the President no
                    longer accepts “autonomy” of the Czecho-Slovak and Jugo-Slav peoples as a basis
                    of peace, see the note transmitted through the Swedish Legation, October 19,
                    1918, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg368">page
                    368</ref>.]</p>




























